[09/09/2026-10:07:16] [TRT] [E] IBuilderConfig::setFlag: Error Code 3: API Usage Error (Parameter check failed, condition: builderFlag != BuilderFlag::kEXCLUDE_LEAN_RUNTIME || flags[BuilderFlag::kVERSION_COMPATIBLE]. kEXCLUDE_LEAN_RUNTIME can only be set if kVERSION_COMPATIBLE is set. In setFlag at /_src/optimizer/api/builderConfig.cpp:157)
    EXCLUDE_LEAN_RUNTIME alone                           55,332 B

    the embedded lean runtime costs 100 MiB on a 54 KiB engine
    -> `EXCLUDE_LEAN_RUNTIME` takes it back to the baseline **exactly, byte for byte**: you keep
       version compatibility and ship the runtime separately (04-Feature/LeanAndDispatchRuntime).
    -> and alone it is a **silent no-op**. No error, no warning, same plan. It only ever
       subtracts something `VERSION_COMPATIBLE` added.
