    plan size without / with MONITOR_MEMORY: 55,332 / 55,332 B
    -> identical. The flag is pure diagnostics: it makes the builder emit memory-usage records
       into the logger, so it is only visible at INFO/VERBOSE severity and only while building.
       Reach for it when a build OOMs and you need to know which phase asked for the memory.
